# Compiled Python bytecode. Derived entirely from the .py sources and
# regenerated on next import, so there is nothing here worth versioning.
# Untracked 2026-09-19: two .pyc files had been committed, including one for
# CPython 3.14 while the repo's .venv is 3.13, so it could never be refreshed.
# They also produced commits whose only content was "a binary blob changed
# because Python ran", which is noise in a history meant to read as a record
# of decisions.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
